{"id":"243363d27f588e48","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-veblen-monotonicity.md","title":"Veblen 函数的单调性与吸收律","display":"thm-veblen-monotonicity — Veblen 函数的单调性与吸收律","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-veblen-monotonicity","aliases":["18-thm-veblen-monotonicity"],"display":"thm-veblen-monotonicity — Veblen 函数的单调性与吸收律","depends_on":["[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","[[18-df-normal-function]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Theorem 3.4.7; Lemma 3.4.8","source_pages":"37","source_pdf_pages":"47","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-veblen-monotonicity"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-veblen-monotonicity</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-veblen-monotonicity — Veblen 函数的单调性与吸收律"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"83adc13498d19c2f\" href=\"?note=83adc13498d19c2f\" title=\"18-df-normal-function\">18-df-normal-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Theorem 3.4.7; Lemma 3.4.8"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"37"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"47"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a> 的 Veblen 族。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Normal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Normal}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83adc13498d19c2f\" href=\"?note=83adc13498d19c2f\" title=\"18-df-normal-function\">18-df-normal-function</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\mathrm{Normal}(\\varphi_\\alpha).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\mathrm{Normal}(\\varphi_\\alpha).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha,\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\xi&lt;\\eta\\to\\varphi_\\alpha(\\xi)&lt;\\varphi_\\alpha(\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha,\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\xi&lt;\\eta\\to\\varphi_\\alpha(\\xi)&lt;\\varphi_\\alpha(\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\n\\bigl(\\varphi_\\alpha(\\gamma)\\le\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\land\n\\varphi_\\alpha(\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma))=\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\n\\bigl(\\varphi_\\alpha(\\gamma)\\le\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\land\n\\varphi_\\alpha(\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma))=\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\bigr)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>已核 Theorem 3.4.7 和 Lemma 3.4.8 的陈述及证明。旧稿错误宣称指标方向处处严格递增：取 α=0、β=1、γ=φ₂(0)，则 γ 同时是 φ₀ 与 φ₁ 的不动点，所以 φ₀(γ)=φ₁(γ)=γ；因此原书仅给 ≤。已查看原书 PDF 47 的页面图像，3.4.8(3) 印刷把自变量方向写反，正文枚举定义与正规性确定正确方向为 ξ&lt;η⇒φ_α(ξ)&lt;φ_α(η)。指标方向的吸收律直接来自较高层值属于较低层不动点类。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-normal-function","status":"resolved","id":"83adc13498d19c2f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-normal-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$，$\\varphi$ 为 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]] 的 Veblen 族。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-normal-function","status":"resolved","id":"83adc13498d19c2f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Normal}$ 见 [[18-df-normal-function]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma,\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Normal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\mathrm{Normal}(\\varphi_\\alpha).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha,\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;(\\xi<\\eta\\to\\varphi_\\alpha(\\xi)<\\varphi_\\alpha(\\eta)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\Bigl(\\alpha<\\beta\\to\n\\bigl(\\varphi_\\alpha(\\gamma)\\le\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\land\n\\varphi_\\alpha(\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma))=\\varphi_\\beta(\\gamma)\\bigr)\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1813,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-69","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-veblen-monotonicity]]"},{"id":"cdc1f90088d43701","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","元数据 · canonical_document","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"本文件是 [[18-thm-veblen-monotonicity]] 的原编号重述入口；所有参数域与该节点相同，下式不引入另一套数学对象或证明关系。"},{"id":"770aefc56bf0351b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-141","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-veblen-monotonicity]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-150","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-veblen-monotonicity|18-thm-veblen-monotonicity]]"}],"outgoing":["40176d5c80238174","83adc13498d19c2f"]}